---
title: "Event-Driven Architecture"
---

flowchart LR

    CHAT["Chat Service"]
    AUTH["Auth Service"]
    USER["User Service"]

    NATS["NATS Event Bus"]

    RT["Realtime Service"]
    NOTIF["Notification Service"]
    SEARCH["Search Service"]

    CHAT -- chat.message.created --> NATS
    AUTH -- user.created --> NATS
    USER -- user.profile.updated --> NATS

    NATS --> RT
    NATS --> NOTIF
    NATS --> SEARCH